In children, this is not as correct.  They see something on TV and they may 
think it is real or something to do.  You watch kids playing Batman and Robin 
(when I was young).  Robin says corny things.  Batman drives around in the 
Batmobile.  They fight the bad guys.

Now, when I was a kid, someone would say Holy whatever, Batman.
We would ride our Big Wheels around like they were the Batmobile.
We would go through the pow-bam-smack just like the TV show.

