Hard, you are not going to see me tieing a firehose to myself and then jump of 
a building.   But you MAY see a 7 year old trying to do that from a tree 
branch.

This is no reason to ban Die Hard.  This is a reason for the parents to watch 
the movie with the kid, and make sure the kid isn't outside trying such 
stunts.  Likewise, this is no reason to ban any show.

	-Dan

