The follow editorial appeared in The Tartan, Carnegie Mellon's Student
Newspaper on November 7, 1994.  Feel free to redistribute this editorial.

Andrew Sproule
Tartan Editor-in-Chief

------------------------------------------------------------------
The Tartan                    Editor-in-Chief: Andrew Sproule
Box 17                        Managing Editor: Samuel Greenfield
Carnegie Mellon University    E-mail: tartan+@andrew.cmu.edu
Pittsburgh, PA  15213-3890    Phone: (412) 268-2111
